---
source: system/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"fsfreeze\")"
---
Suspend or resume access to a filesystem

Usage: fsfreeze [OPTIONS] <MOUNTPOINT>

Arguments:
  <MOUNTPOINT>  Mountpoint of the filesystem

Options:
  -f, --freeze    Freeze the filesystem
  -u, --unfreeze  Unfreeze the filesystem
  -h, --help      Print help
